TownBoss governance is mandatory. Read root `AGENTS.md` and the listed governance documents before write-capable work. Require repository/branch/SHA/status and Phase/Deliverable/Task preflight; preserve unrelated dirty work; prohibit destructive Git recovery by default. Do not report DONE without validation, project docs/Memory, TownBoss reconciliation when applicable, compliant checkpoint, and verified remote SHA.

For UI work, apply the canonical TownBoss UX Engine reference audit and project UX authority before considering external patterns. References are subordinate; record lifecycle and implementation SHA, make fixture/real state explicit, collect rendered evidence, and require independent visual review. Tests and golden images alone are not visual acceptance.
